Sand Animation demo: Where the Sparrow Went

Picture: generated in code (demo/sand.js, shapes.js, main.js). No images, footage or textures.
Music and sound: synthesised in code (demo/mix.py, numpy/scipy). No samples, no sample libraries.
Font: IM Fell English (Regular), Copyright (c) 2007 Igino Marini, SIL Open Font License 1.1, via core/fonts/ (subset of Latin glyphs); used only to rasterise the word "home." into sand grains.
Voice: none.
Tools: Node, Playwright/Chromium (rendering), ffmpeg (mux, loudnorm, grain), Python with numpy, scipy, soundfile.
